{"id":"17-agents","number":17,"slug":"decision-models-in-agents","title":"Decision models inside agents","short":"Inside agents","module":"Real systems","summary":"Agents make dozens of small decisions per task: which tool, which skill, are these arguments grounded, is it time to ask the user, is the task done. Here is where a fast decision model fits in an agent loop, a gate that stops an agent from guessing, what skill selection gained in TypeSafe's test, and real-time control at ten decisions a second.","voice":"Jessica","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Agents are where language models make the most decisions per minute: which tool, which file, ask or act, done or not. Most of those decisions are small. That's where a fast decision model belongs.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 17","module":"Module 5 · Real systems","title":"Decision models *inside agents*","subtitle":"Let the LLM make the hard calls, and a decider the rote ones.","cast":["mull","snap"]},"start":0.5,"dur":14.287,"words":[{"text":"Agents","s":0.8,"e":1.24},{"text":"are","s":1.28,"e":1.413},{"text":"where","s":1.44,"e":1.584},{"text":"language","s":1.6,"e":2},{"text":"models","s":2.08,"e":2.4},{"text":"make","s":2.48,"e":2.64},{"text":"the","s":2.72,"e":2.8},{"text":"most","s":2.88,"e":3.12},{"text":"decisions","s":3.2,"e":3.68},{"text":"per","s":3.76,"e":3.84},{"text":"minute:","s":3.92,"e":4.64},{"text":"which","s":4.76,"e":4.88},{"text":"tool,","s":4.96,"e":5.44},{"text":"which","s":5.56,"e":5.68},{"text":"file,","s":5.76,"e":6.48},{"text":"ask","s":6.68,"e":6.88},{"text":"or","s":6.96,"e":7.04},{"text":"act,","s":7.12,"e":7.76},{"text":"done","s":7.96,"e":8.16},{"text":"or","s":8.24,"e":8.32},{"text":"not.","s":8.4,"e":9},{"text":"Most","s":9.28,"e":9.52},{"text":"of","s":9.6,"e":9.68},{"text":"those","s":9.76,"e":9.84},{"text":"decisions","s":9.96,"e":10.32},{"text":"are","s":10.36,"e":10.4},{"text":"small.","s":10.48,"e":11.28},{"text":"That's","s":11.4,"e":11.6},{"tex