 call this tool \"","                                  \"before clarifying with the user?\"),","            })","        if a[\"grounded\"] < 0.5 or a[\"premature\"] > 0.5:","            return Guide(\"Ask the user which city they mean.\")","        return Proceed()"],"hl":[{"from":6,"to":9,"label":"two narrow questions","tone":"agent","at":"two narrow questions"},{"from":11,"to":12,"label":"guide, don't refuse","tone":"good","at":"asks which city"}],"caption":"Adapted from strands-decider/examples/strands. `Guide` hands the turn back with feedback instead of failing.","caption_at":"A few lines"},"start":52.527,"dur":28.979,"words":[{"text":"Here's","s":52.827,"e":53.147},{"text":"the","s":53.187,"e":53.227},{"text":"Strands","s":53.307,"e":53.707},{"text":"example.","s":53.987,"e":54.547},{"text":"The","s":54.827,"e":54.907},{"text":"agent","s":54.987,"e":55.307},{"text":"has","s":55.387,"e":55.467},{"text":"a","s":55.507,"e":55.547},{"text":"weather","s":55.627,"e":55.867},{"text":"tool,","s":55.947,"e":56.347},{"text":"and","s":56.427,"e":56.587},{"text":"an","s":56.667,"e":56.747},{"text":"eager","s":56.907,"e":57.147},{"text":"system","s":57.307,"e":57.547},{"text":"prompt.","s":57.627,"e":58.267},{"text":"A","s":58.507,"e":58.547},{"text":"user","s":58.587,"e":58.827},{"text":"asks:","s":58.907,"e":59.507},{"text":"what's","s":59.627,"e":59.787},{"text":"the","s":59.827,"e":59.867},{"text":"weather?","s":59.947,"e":60.347},{"text":"No","s":60.747,"e":60.907},{"text":"city.","s":61.067,"e":61.627},{"text":"The","s":61.867,"e":61.947},{"text":"agent","s":62.027,"e":62.267},{"text":"guesses","s":62.347,"e":62.747},{"text":"one","s":62.827,"e":63.067},{"text":"and","s":63.147,"e":63.227},{"text":"calls","s":63.307,"e":63.547},{"text":"the","s":63.587,"e":63.627},{"text":"tool.","s":63.707,"e":64.267},{"text":"But","s":64.507,"e":64.587},{"text":"before","s":64.667,"e":64.987},{"text":"the","s":65.027,"e":65.067},{"text":"call","s":65.147,"e":65.387},{"text":"runs,